      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T19:35:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems to conflict with the change in gki_aarch64_protected_modules, IIUC. If a module is in `gki_aarch64_protected_modules`, then it is a protected GKI module and it cannot be overridden like this in _KUNIT_FRAMEWORK_MODULES. \n\nI wonder why this builds. I think it should be either of the following:\n\nIf you drop kunit.ko from gki_aarch64_protected_modules, this is okay, and the kunit.ko you get from :kunit_aarch64 is unsigned. It is an \"overridden\" GKI module.\n\nIf you keep kunit.ko on gki_aarch64_protected_modules, then kunit.ko needs to be deleted here at module_outs. Instead, `kunit_aarch64_dist` below may add `//common:kernel_aarch64/lib/kunit/kunit.ko`, to add the signed GKI module in the distribution directory.\n\n@ramjiyani@google.com to fact check what I said above.",
      "revId": "990bdac55206a710c48c03104209dabf86086bc2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "69ade7da_99480b47",
        "filename": "BUILD.bazel",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 807,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-23T19:42:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On a second thought, this can\u0027t be a signed GKI module because you are loading the kernel image from one AB build (e.g. build number 123456 kernel_aarch64) and kunit.ko from the anoterh AB build (e.g. build number 123456 some other target). The signature from kunit.ko won\u0027t match the public key in the kernel image because they are from different builds.\n\nBut if you build the bazel target :kunit_aarch64 \u0026 :kernel_aarch64 in the same AB build, then having kunit.ko as a protected GKI module is fine. In that case I would even prefer it to be a protected module to prevent loading a different module accidentally.",
      "parentUuid": "c69cf2c0_ab8a7cf0",
      "revId": "990bdac55206a710c48c03104209dabf86086bc2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
